# Lightning Pose App git (this Studio)

## Features and bugfixes

- New short-lived branch from `origin/main`, then a PR into `main`. One branch per feature or bugfix bundle. Combining is fine when the changes touch the same part of the code.
- Do not open PRs from `jmrfox/dev`.
- Do not `git push` to `main` for code, scripts, or config.

## Simple docs-only edits

Examples: `README.md`, `CHANGELOG.md`, `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `DEV.md`, `AGENTS.md` (wording only), `feature_plans/*.md`.

- Edit on **`main`**. No feature branch or PR.
- **Do not `git commit` or `git push`.** Leave the working tree for review; Jordan commits and pushes.

If a “docs” change also touches scripts, CI, or app code, treat it as a feature branch + PR.

## Commits in general

- Commit, push, open, merge, or close PRs **only when asked**.
- Do not run `./scripts/publish_github_release.sh` unless asked.
